[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
ocibhyve boots guests from the OCIBHYVE kernel in /boot/kernel.OCIBHYVE:

  pkg install FreeBSD-set-kernels-ocibhyve

Any image runs. One without the guest agent gets a copy of the host's,
%%PREFIX%%/libexec/ocibhyve-agent, for the life of the container.
%%PREFIX%%/share/examples/ocibhyve/Containerfile builds an image with
the agent in it. See ocibhyve(8).

Use it with podman:

  podman --runtime ocibhyve run --rm ghcr.io/freebsd/freebsd-runtime:15.1 uname -r
EOM
}
]
